hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1122","(148) Dushman ke qareeb maal-e-ghana'im ki taqseem mein jaldi karne ke bare mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Ji'ranah mein maal-e-ghana'im taqseem farma rahe the to ek shakhs khara hua aur kaha: Adl karen kyunke Aap ne adl nahin kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tujh par afsos! Agar main adl na karun to kaun adl karega? Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Mujhe chhor den ke main is munafiq ki gardan maar dun, to Aap ne farmaya: Use chhor do, beshak is ke sath kuch sathi hain, ya (farmaya:) is ke sathiyon mein (aise log hain), jo Quran parhte hain (lekin) jo un ke halq se tajawuz nahin karta, deen se is tarah nikal jate hain jaise teer shikar se (paar) nikal jata hai."
